{"pageid":923,"title":"Intersection Conveyor","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Intersection Conveyor</span>","revid":11564,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><big>\"3 Way Intersection Conveyor - Try toggling the switch between all 3 modes! It's really useful for making any form of sorting system\"</big></i>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Intersection Conveyor</h2>\n\n\t<div class=\"pi-image-collection wds-tabber\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a92dd9916361-0\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a92dd9916361-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnboxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a92dd9916361-1\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a92dd9916361-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a92dd9916361-0\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a92dd9916361-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Intersection_Conveyor.png/revision/latest?cb=20230712200519\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Unboxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Intersection_Conveyor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230712200519\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Intersection_Conveyor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230712200519 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Intersection_Conveyor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20230712200519 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Unboxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"184\" data-image-key=\"Intersection Conveyor.png\" data-image-name=\"Intersection Conveyor.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a92dd9916361-1\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a92dd9916361-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Intersection_Conveyor_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20240108050323\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Boxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Intersection_Conveyor_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240108050323\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Intersection_Conveyor_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240108050323 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Intersection_Conveyor_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20240108050323 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Boxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"223\" data-image-key=\"Intersection Conveyor 2.png\" data-image-name=\"Intersection Conveyor 2.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$820</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Merge two separate conveyor lines into one</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.19.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 6th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Intersection Conveyor</b> is a structure that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It is a T-shaped conveyor belt section that allows for advanced conveyor belt setups.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Functionality\">Functionality</span></h2>\n<p>When placed, the Intersection Conveyor defaults to its center position. Toggling the switch determines the direction of the output; the other two conveyor sections will become inputs.\n</p><p>The Intersection Conveyor serves two separate purposes. The first purpose is merging two separate inputs into one output, such as bringing together both a wood processing line and a stone processing line together for a unified output to a truck or trailer. The second purpose is to create a filtering or sorting system, which generally involves the use of <a href=\"/wiki/Logic\" title=\"Logic\">Logic</a>. A rudimentary use would be to create a junction that sits between a Refinery and a Forge to allow <a href=\"/wiki/Lithium\" title=\"Lithium\">Lithium</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Magnetite\" title=\"Magnetite\">Magnetite</a> to bypass the Forge, allowing them to retain their full value.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unlike almost all other conveyor belt sections, the Intersection Conveyor does not have a large version.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829132441\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 93/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019503/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.187      1 Templat